Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.49,0:00:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See if this will work!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.69,0:00:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm transferring the code!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna teleport!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.49,0:00:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.01,0:00:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.51,0:00:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mapping data available.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.01,0:00:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then do you know where Asuna is? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.65,0:00:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very close, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.57,0:01:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the top of the world tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's supposed to be\Na floating city up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was never any grand quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole damn thing was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.15,0:01:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.57,0:01:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.77,0:01:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we got to get Asuna out\Nof here first, right? Mm-hmm.
