Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry I took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always knew you'd save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.03,0:04:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, ready to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you log Asuna out from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her status is locked by complicated\Ncodes that I don't have access to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll need to find a system\Nconsole to bypass them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found a console in\Nthe laboratory. I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.59,0:05:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ewing, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful! Something...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something bad is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Julie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing I expected to find was\Na cockroach in my little bird's cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding! It's Sugou!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.73,0:05:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer it if you didn't\Ncall me that name in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.81,0:05:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should address me as His\NHighness, the Fairy King Oberon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.31,0:06:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna know why you can't move?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little something called gravity\Nmagic coming out in the next update.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think the players will go for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something, Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or should I call you Kirito instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you manage to\Nget all the way up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw a strange program\Nrunning, is that how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.93,0:06:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I flew up here with my wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to tell me, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just go ask your mind instead. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't really think I went to all that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.75,0:06:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trouble setting this whole\Nthing up just for fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.39,0:06:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have 300 former players\Nof SAO under my thumb,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.53,0:06:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now thanks to their\Ndedicated cooperation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.71,0:06:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The technology I developed\Nfor total control
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.17,0:06:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of emotions and thought is 80 % complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.53,0:06:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to achieve what no one else has.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.97,0:07:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The total control of the human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.59,0:07:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so close I can almost taste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank god for\Nvirtual reality, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugou!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're never going to get\Naway with this, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who do you think's going to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.45,0:07:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sadly, there's none in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for yours truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I start tinkering\Nwith your little souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why don't we have ourselves a little fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.59,0:08:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.73,0:08:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I was hoping for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get NPC girls\Nto make faces like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.19,0:08:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you smell lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.95,0:08:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figuring out how to replicate the way\Nyou smell in real life was a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't even get me\Nstarted on how hard it was to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get an analyzer into your\Nhospital room undetected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stay down and\Ngrovel like a good little doggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:09:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System command, chase the pain\Nabsorber from level 10 to level 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurts, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll increase the pain gradually to\Ngive you something to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once it drops below level three, it'll\Nstart affecting your body in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.11,0:09:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugou!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever he does, he's\Nnot really hurting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.83,0:09:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd say that, but I wonder\Nhow long your pride's going to last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.67,0:09:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,30 minutes? An hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we see how long\Nyou can hang on to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.57,0:10:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that that's out of the way, would\Nyou like to know what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.95,0:10:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we've had our fun here, I'm going\Nto pay you a visit at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll set up a big monitor\Nand play back a recording
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of this and we can enjoy\Nourselves all over again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this time with your real body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.17,0:10:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy, how sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.63,0:10:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! You hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:10:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.23,0:11:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I being punished for thinking\NI was some kind of hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For thinking I was the only\None who could save Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For thinking I was strong\Nenough, even though I'm not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.97,0:11:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.92,0:11:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm facing reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you are giving up to the\Npower of a system you once defied.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What choice do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.93,0:11:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's the GM.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then our battle was... what? A joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember how\Nyou showed me the power
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the human will was\Nsuperior to the system?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How you showed me the\Npossibilities of the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.11,0:12:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.69,0:12:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up, Kirito. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your attacks are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blades in SAO hit way harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.67,0:12:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they hurt way more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.23,0:12:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a few bugs left to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System login.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.07,0:12:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ID Heathcliff. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose ID are you using?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:13:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System command.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enable administrator privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.95,0:13:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set ID Oberon to level one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An ID that outranks mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.23,0:13:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my world. I'm the creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm its ruler, its king, its god!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stole everything in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.43,0:13:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything, including its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a king of thieves,\Nsitting alone on your stolen throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.29,0:13:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.59,0:13:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare talk to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System command!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate Object!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ID Excalibur!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as I say, you piece of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System, your God is\Nordering you to comply!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you can wait a little bit longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will only take a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System Command!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate Object!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.49,0:13:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ID Excalibur!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A simple command summons a\Nlegendary weapon. Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.01,0:14:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to settle the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The King of Thieves\Nversus the Gilded Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System command. Set Pain\NAbsorber to Level 0.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not that. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just flinch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the other guy never flinched,\Nno matter how bad things got.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akihiko Kayaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.53,0:14:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kayaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was his ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you still getting in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are always doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acting all high and\Nmighty, like some big shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking everything that\Nwas rightfully mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.69,0:14:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugou, in a way, I get\Nwhere you're coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:15:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost to him too, and\Nthen I had to go work for,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but whatever happened, I never\Nwanted to be him, unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.95,0:15:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's nothing like the\Npain you made Asuna feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.55,0:15:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.87,0:15:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hand! My hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.15,0:16:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.13,0:16:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always have, always will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.23,0:16:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know you'll always save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.87,0:16:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:17:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll do my best to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got to be nighttime\Nalready back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.87,0:17:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll see you at the\Nhospital as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to be the first\Nperson I see when I wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally over, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going home back to the\Nreal world, that's right.
