Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a lot's changed, so\Ntry not to freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go places and do fun things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the two of us—sound\Ngood, yeah, real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.37,0:18:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it, game over, or is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Heathcliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heathcliff
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to see you again, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.09,0:18:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could say I'm alive, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.49,0:18:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, I'm the afterimage of\Nthe mind that was Akihiko Kayaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An echo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.39,0:18:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, as usual, I have no idea\Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I should thank you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not exactly friends, so we\Nshouldn't expect favors from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.41,0:18:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always okay, what do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.47,0:19:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this—the beginnings of a\Nnew world, I call it the seed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it sprouts, you'll know what it is;\Nwhat you do with it is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can even delete it if?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.57,0:19:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if you still have a tiny bit\Nof fondness left for the virtual world,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.87,0:19:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should get going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do hope we meet again, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.03,0:19:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.31,0:19:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.43,0:19:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hid myself inside the local\Nmemory of your nerve gear rig.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Mama? Don't worry. She's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's back home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.29,0:20:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise we'll be back to visit soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I don't know how much longer\Nthis world's going to be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter because my core\Nprogram's inside your nerve gear now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.99,0:20:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we'll always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.75,0:20:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right. I better head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.81,0:20:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go see Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.44,0:20:36.69,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H44&\fs57\blur1.2\pos(1014,189.75)\frz352.2\c&HE6E5E9&}Are you sure you want to log out?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:35.44,0:20:36.69,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H44&\fs57\blur1.2\pos(1012.5,187.5)\frz352.2\c&HA296BC&}Are you sure you want to log out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.07,0:20:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.31,0:20:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you didn't log out right\Naway, I got worried, and then I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.99,0:20:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I took so long to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.59,0:20:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really over now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.55,0:20:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.87,0:21:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.33,0:21:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sugu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all the help you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have done it on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.15,0:21:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the reason I was able to finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.17,0:21:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.07,0:21:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to thank me for a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just happy I got the chance to\Nhelp my big brother in his world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.23,0:21:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened with Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you get her back? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.63,0:21:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's back in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugu, I... Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.21,0:21:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gotta be wondering\Nwhere you're at by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.81,0:21:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.47,0:22:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.87,0:22:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.47,0:22:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And say hi to Asuna for me. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.01,0:22:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for you\Nguys to meet for real.
